## DeveloperExtension

**Namespace:** `Cyrena.Coding`
**Assembly:** `Cyrena.Coding.Extension`

### Purpose
Entry point for the `cyrena.developer` extension. Registers the developer assistant mode and Blazor feature assembly.

### Class Definition

```csharp
public class DeveloperExtension : Extension
{
    public override void BuildExtension(CyrenaBuilder builder)
    {
        builder.AddDeveloperRuntime();
    }
}
```

### Extension Manifest

```json
{
  "id": "cyrena.developer",
  "name": "Coding Assistant",
  "version": "0.4.0",
  "entryAssemblyFile": "Cyrena.Coding.Extension.dll",
  "description": "Adds a coding assistant for further use in development plugins.",
  "dependencies": [{ "id": "cyrena", "minVersion": "0.4.0" }],
  "requireFrameworkBuilder": true
}
```

### Registration
```csharp
public static CyrenaBuilder AddDeveloperRuntime(this CyrenaBuilder builder)
{
    builder.AddAssistantMode<DeveloperAssistantMode>();
    builder.AddFeatureAssembly<DeveloperAssistantMode>("blazor");
    return builder;
}
```
